@ApiService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5180

### Clinicians and their upcoming workload
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/clinicians
Accept: application/json

### Upcoming appointments for a clinician
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/appointments?clinicianId=2
Accept: application/json

### A single appointment
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/1
Accept: application/json

### Book an appointment
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clinicianId": 2,
  "patientId": 5,
  "startsAt": "2027-01-12T14:30:00+00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "reason": "Chest pain follow-up"
}

### 400 validation problem details
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clinicianId": 2,
  "patientId": 5,
  "startsAt": "2020-01-01T09:10:00+00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 20,
  "reason": ""
}

### Cancel an appointment
POST {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/1/cancel

### 404 problem details
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/appointments/9999
Accept: application/problem+json

### OpenAPI document
GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
